2. SOURCES OF DATA
How we obtain information depends on how you use the Services. For example, we may collect information:
you provide directly to us, such as when you contact us through email or online form, through the support feature embedded in our Services, or through another form of inquiry;
automatically when you download and use our Services, purchase or redeem one of our products or services, including in-app purchases and subscriptions or participating in an activity of functionality of our Services where you provide your information;
from publicly available sources and third-party platforms, such as when you sync our Services with third-party accounts, post to our social media pages, or through publicly accessible comments, reviews, or posts on social media and other online forums;
automatically, including through cookies and similar tracking technologies;
from third parties, such as advertising and marketing networks or business partners.
Information received from app stores and distribution platforms, such as the Apple App Store and Google Play Store, including information and signals made available to us in connection with your access to, download, or use of our Services, in accordance with the applicable app store’s terms and privacy policies.
